// The query language front end: tokens, syntax tree, and the parser.
//
// The language is a pipeline. A query names a source and then a chain of
// stages, each of which feeds the next:
//
//   from app.log
//     | where level == "error"
//     | stats count() as n, avg(duration) as mean by service
//     | sort n desc
//     | limit 5
//
// Parsing is separate from execution: this package only produces a syntax tree
// and reports where a mistake is, which keeps the planner and the executor free
// of character level concerns.
import {
  "haol-05/moonloom",
  "haol-05/moonloom/ascii",
  "moonbitlang/core/debug",
}
